Source PDF: https://mmathphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/sites/g/files/vzsiac2991/files/mmathphys/documents/media/a18926h1.pdf

These solutions use the source paper's crossing convention for <anyon R-matrices>, its <physics normalization of anyon diagrams> in Question 1, and its <isotopy normalization of anyon diagrams> in Question 2. In particular, its <normalized Kirby color> is $\Omega=\mathcal D^{-1}\sum_a d_a a$.

